                                                "sense_id": "0252af3b-21db-3b74-82be-67dd2df3403f",
                                                "text": "The letters \"SC\" inscribed on the smokebox door of a locomotive denote that it is fitted with a self-cleaning smokebox."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2262f292-8198-4e6b-af75-c5eeb5871791",
                                                "sense_id": "0252af3b-21db-3b74-82be-67dd2df3403f",
                                                "text": "A further disadvantage of the Crosti system is that it is impossible to fit a self-cleaning smokebox."
                                            }
